      "id": "claim_5fd183411cce4bf3a77088d7f83d9966",
      "statement": "Notion MCP tools use the hosted server at `https://mcp.notion.com/mcp` and are loaded only for a private thread's recorded owner; each discovered tool is wrapped with required `on_behalf_of`, then at call time validates the participant and private owner, fetches a current token, rebuilds the named MCP tool, and invokes it without the wrapper field.",
